invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: ch_ticket_obfuscated_age returns the age without ticket_age_add, so
  every resumed ClientHello sends the ticket's age in the clear and a
  passive observer links the connections that resume one ticket, which
  RFC 9846 section 4.3.11.1 adds the value to prevent. A server in this
  tree ignores the field, so every resumption still completes; the rows
  that add age_add modulo 2^32 object.

--- old
    return (uint32_t)age_ms + ticket->age_add;
--- new
    (void)ticket;
    return (uint32_t)age_ms;
